   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Percentage of health and non- health products procured by UNDP meet international quality standards and passing quality assurance tests.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Method: Routine cross verification of products to be procured with WHO and GF QA list. 
 
Numerator: Number of health and non- health products procured by UNDP meet international quality standards and passing quality assurance tests.
Denominator: Total Number of health and non- health products procured by UNDP.

Risks: 
- Major manufactures stop product of health and non- products to be procured. 
- Health and non- health products requested to be procured not in the quality assured product list.</narrative>
